<span> and </span><strong>free domains</strong><span>:</span></p>
<h2>Free Hosting (for static or simple sites)</h2>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong><span> — free for static sites, custom domain support, HTTPS included.</span></li>
<li><strong>Netlify</strong><span> — free tier with drag-and-drop deploy, custom domain, forms, and serverless functions.</span></li>
<li><strong>Vercel</strong><span> — free for frontend/React/Vue/Next.js projects, custom domains, generous bandwidth.</span></li>
<li><strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong><span> — free static site hosting with unlimited bandwidth and custom domains.</span></li>
<li><strong>Surge.sh / Render / Railway</strong><span> — also have free tiers.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2>Free Domains</h2>
<ul dir="ltr">
