<li><strong>Free custom TLDs</strong><span>: Freenom used to offer </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.tk</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.ml</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.ga</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.cf</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.gq</span><span> for free, but it is now unreliable/blocked by many registrars. I wouldn’t recommend it for a business site.</span></li>
<li><strong>Paid but cheap</strong><span>: </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.com</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.in</span><span>, </span><span dir="auto" class="rounded-1.5 inline px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] leading-[1.375rem] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] break-words text-[var(--fg-secondary)] [background:linear-gradient(var(--bg-muted),var(--bg-muted)),var(--bg-translucent)]">.co</span><span> domains usually cost ₹500–₹1,500/year from Namecheap, GoDaddy, or Cloudflare Registrar.</span></li>
