<p dir="ltr">Would you like help publishing your current KRSS site, or connecting a custom domain you already own?</p></div><div class="flex items-center" data-testid="agent-message-toolbar" data-message-copy-text="Here are realistic options for free hosting and free domains:

Free Hosting (for static or simple sites)
- GitHub Pages — free for static sites, custom domain support, HTTPS included.
- Netlify — free tier with drag-and-drop deploy, custom domain, forms, and serverless functions.
- Vercel — free for frontend/React/Vue/Next.js projects, custom domains, generous bandwidth.
- Cloudflare Pages — free static site hosting with unlimited bandwidth and custom domains.
- Surge.sh / Render / Railway — also have free tiers.

Free Domains
- Free subdomains: `yourname.netlify.app`, `yourname.vercel.app`, `yourname.github.io`, `yourname.pages.dev` — these are free and reliable.
- Free custom TLDs: Freenom used to offer `.tk`, `.ml`, `.ga`, `.cf`, `.gq` for free, but it is now unreliable/blocked by many registrars. I wouldn’t recommend it for a business site.
- Paid but cheap: `.com`, `.in`, `.co` domains usually cost ₹500–₹1,500/year from Namecheap, GoDaddy, or Cloudflare Registrar.

For your KRSS site
Your project is already hosted for free on Lovable at:
- `https://precise-plans-studio.lovable.app`

You can also buy and connect a custom domain directly inside Lovable from Project Settings → Domains, but that requires a paid plan.

